WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:11.900
The Cases module handles customer support requests, with channel, priority and an SLA deadline.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.990
We open a case to see the whole conversation with the customer and reply over time.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:24.070
Each case has a deadline by priority, with an SLA traffic light: on time, at risk or breached.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:33.210
On closing, the customer answers the satisfaction survey, and Analytics summarises CSAT, NPS and SLA compliance.

